| `canary.workers` | integer | `1` | a whole number, 1 or more | `scripts/canary.py` | Sets how many canary projects render and verify at once; each runs a whole project verify, so more workers need the cores and memory for that many. Read only in the template repository; absent, the canary writes `[using default] canary.workers = 1` to stderr. | the farm job's size: `launcher.long_scripts.<name>.cpus` | always |
